msgstr "Admissions 2026/2027"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Bakalavr <em>qabuli</em>"
msgstr "Bachelor's <em>admission</em>"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"Davlat qabul tartibi asosida — «avval test, keyin tanlov» tamoyili bo‘yicha "
"bakalavriatga hujjat topshirish."
msgstr ""
"Applying for undergraduate study under the national admissions procedure, "
"based on the principle of \"test first, then choose\"."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html base.html kvota_va_ballar.html
msgid "Bakalavr qabuli"
msgstr "Bachelor's Admission"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Iyun — ro‘yxatdan o‘tish"
msgstr "June — registration"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Maksimal DTM balli"
msgstr "Maximum STC score"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Test fanlari"
msgstr "Test subjects"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Kun — OTM tanlash"
msgstr "Days to choose a university"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html magistr_qabuli.html
msgid "Umumiy ma’lumot"
msgstr "Overview"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Bakalavriatga qabul tartibi"
msgstr "The undergraduate admissions procedure"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"O‘zbekiston Respublikasida 2024/2025 o‘quv yilidan joriy etilgan «avval test"
" — keyin tanlov» tizimi asosida amalga oshiriladi. Rasmiy platforma:"
msgstr ""
"Admission follows the \"test first, then choose\" system introduced in the "
"Republic of Uzbekistan in the 2024/2025 academic year. The official platform"
" is:"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html topshiriladigan_hujjatlar.html
msgid "my.uzbmb.uz"
msgstr "my.uzbmb.uz"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html sport_va_hordiq.html
msgid "Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish"
msgstr "Register"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"my.uzbmb.uz da pasport, JSHSHIR va telefon orqali ariza. Fan bloki, ta’lim "
"tili va test hududi tanlanadi."
msgstr ""
"Apply on my.uzbmb.uz using your passport, personal identification number and"
" phone number. You select your subject block, language of instruction and "
"test region."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Kirish testi (DTM)"
msgstr "Entrance test (STC)"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"5 ta fan: 3 majburiy + 2 profil. 90 ta savol, maksimal 189 ball. Natija "
"shaxsiy kabinetda e’lon qilinadi."
msgstr ""
"Five subjects: three compulsory and two specialist. 90 questions, a maximum "
"of 189 points. Results are published in your personal account."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "OTM va yo‘nalish tanlash"
msgstr "Choosing a university and programme"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"Ball e’lonidan keyin 15 kun ichida universitet, yo‘nalish va ta’lim shakli "
"(grant / kontrakt) tanlanadi."
msgstr ""
"Within 15 days of the results being published, you choose your university, "
"programme and mode of funding (state grant or fee-paying)."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Bosqichlar"
msgstr "Stages"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "2026/2027 qabul kalendari"
msgstr "Admissions calendar for 2026/2027"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Davlat OTMlari bakalavriati uchun asosiy muddatlar."
msgstr "Key dates for undergraduate study at state universities."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "5–25 iyun"
msgstr "5–25 June"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Onlayn ro‘yxatdan o‘tish"
msgstr "Online registration"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"my.uzbmb.uz portali orqali ariza topshirish. Maktab, litsey va kollej "
"bitiruvchilari odatda to‘lovdan ozod."
msgstr ""
"Applications are submitted via the my.uzbmb.uz portal. School, lyceum and "
"college leavers are usually exempt from the fee."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Iyul–avgust"
msgstr "July–August"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Test sinovlari"
msgstr "Test sittings"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"Belgilangan maydonchalarda DTM testlari. Sana va vaqt shaxsiy kabinetda "
"ko‘rsatiladi."
msgstr ""
"STC tests take place at designated venues. The date and time are shown in "
"your personal account."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "15 kun"
msgstr "15 days"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Varnet va yo‘nalishni tanlash"
msgstr "Choosing Varnet and your programme"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"Ballingizga qarab biotexnologiya, ekologiya va boshqa yo‘nalishlarga ariza "
"berasiz."
msgstr ""
"Depending on your score, you apply for biotechnology, ecology or another "
"programme."

