msgstr "Who can apply?"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Umumiy o‘rta yoki o‘rta maxsus, kasb-hunar ta’limini tugatganlar"
msgstr ""
"Anyone who has completed general secondary, specialised secondary or "
"vocational education"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "DTM testida minimal o‘tish balliga erishganlar"
msgstr "Applicants who have achieved the minimum pass mark in the STC test"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid "Chet tili sertifikati (IELTS/GCT B1+) — til fanida imtiyoz beradi"
msgstr ""
"A foreign language certificate (IELTS/GCT B1+) grants an exemption for the "
