msgstr "Submit an online application or contact the admissions office."

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html home.html kvota_va_ballar.html
#: topshiriladigan_hujjatlar.html universitet_haqida.html
msgid "Hujjat topshirish"
msgstr "Apply now"

#: bakalavr_qabuli.html
msgid ""
"Profil fanlar har yili Vazirlik tomonidan tasdiqlanadi. Aniq blokni <a "
"href=\"https://my.uzbmb.uz\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">my.uzbmb.uz</a> portalidan tekshiring."
msgstr ""
"Specialist subjects are approved annually by the Ministry. Check the exact "
"subject block on the <a href=\"https://my.uzbmb.uz\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">my.uzbmb.uz</a> portal."

